WEBVTT

00:00:05.514 --> 00:00:11.514
Choose Encoding in the side menu.

00:00:14.873 --> 00:00:20.873
Check the Failed encodes section.

00:00:24.232 --> 00:00:30.232
Check the Processing badge for your video.

00:00:34.796 --> 00:00:40.796
Wait until Processing shows
the progress bar moving.

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:54.700
Scroll to Failed in the list.

00:00:57.523 --> 00:01:03.523
Check that It did not finish
appears in the red box.

00:01:09.427 --> 00:01:15.427
Click Retry encoding Our Solar System.
